  "raw_meta_yaml": "context:\n  name: pygeomapper\n  version: \"0.3.0\"\n\npackage:\n  name: ${{ name|lower }}\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://pypi.org/packages/source/${{ name[0] }}/${{ name }}/${{ name }}-${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: f58ea4acd92932851accf8d012d63ebb78123f9e008f4cc78689988c33c0c5f4\n  patches:\n    # forge3d is not on conda-forge; the conda build has no forge3d render\n    # backend and render_with_forge3d uses the built-in Rust fallback\n    - drop-forge3d.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  skip:\n    - win\n    # pyo3 0.22 supports CPython up to 3.13\n    - match(python, \">=3.14\")\n  script:\n    content:\n      - cargo-bundle-licenses --format yaml --output THIRDPARTY.yml\n      - ${{ PYTHON }} -m pip install . -vv --no-deps --no-build-isolation\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - if: build_platform != target_platform\n      then:\n        - python\n        - cross-python_${{ target_platform }}\n        - maturin >=1.5,<2\n    - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n    - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n    - ${{ compiler('rust') }}\n    - cargo-bundle-licenses\n  host:\n    - python\n    - pip\n    - maturin >=1.5,<2\n  run:\n    - python\n    - numpy >=1.22.0\n    - scipy >=1.9.0\n    - matplotlib-base >=3.6.0\n    - rasterio >=1.3.0\n    - pyproj >=3.4.0\n    - tifffile >=2023.1.0\n    - pillow >=9.0.0\n    - pystac-client >=0.7.0\n    - scikit-learn >=1.2.0\n    - spyndex >=0.4.0\n    - xdem >=0.0.18\n    - pywbt >=0.2.0\n\ntests:\n  - python:\n      imports:\n        - pygeomapper\n        - pygeomapper._core\n        - pygeomapper.terrain_analysis\n        - pygeomapper.spectral_indices\n        - pygeomapper.surface_change\n        - pygeomapper.viewer_3d\n        - pygeomapper.cross_section\n        - pygeomapper.raster_io\n      pip_check: true\n\nabout:\n  summary: A toolkit for automated geological and geomorphic mapping from surface geology, remote sensing and DEM data, with 3D terrain visualization and analysis\n  license: AGPL-3.0-or-later\n  license_file:\n    - LICENSE\n    - NOTICE\n    - THIRDPARTY.yml\n  homepage: https://github.com/GeoLarryLai/pyGeoMapper\n  repository: https://github.com/GeoLarryLai/pyGeoMapper\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - GeoLarryLai\n",
